<title>USA: Saga Communications votes 5-for-4 split.</title>
<headline>Saga Communications votes 5-for-4 split.</headline>
<dateline>GROSSE POINTE FARMS, Mich. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saga Communications Inc said Tuesday its board voted a five-for-four stock split effective April 1 to holders of record March 17.</p>
<p>The split will be the broadcasting company's third such split since its initial public offering in December 1992. Prior to the split the company had 8,214 average shares outstanding at December 31.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
